sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as RTO officer
  participant P as Portal
  participant S as OwnershipService
  participant DB as MySQL (1 transaction)
  participant N as Notifications
  O->>P: approve transfer
  P->>S: POST /ownership-transfers/{id}/approve
  Note over S: AuthInterceptor requires<br/>vehicle.transfer_approve
  S->>DB: lock transfer row (FOR UPDATE)
  S->>DB: lock vehicle row (FOR UPDATE)
  S->>DB: lock current ownership row (FOR UPDATE)
  Note over S: transfer PENDING, vehicle ACTIVE,<br/>from-citizen is still owner,<br/>transferee not blacklisted, date valid
  S->>DB: close old ownership (effective_to)
  S->>DB: flush (frees unique slot)
  S->>DB: insert new ownership
  S->>DB: transfer status = APPROVED
  S->>DB: insert 2 audit_logs rows
  S->>N: queue 2 notifications
  DB-->>S: COMMIT
  N->>DB: after commit: QUEUED rows,<br/>then SENT or FAILED
  S-->>P: 200 JSON
